From a222b0a12be8bfdb576dbd90a49259af8bc4aaa6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 00:00:45 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Reopen UTXO and monetary stores after an ordinary
 connect.

Destroy both store objects and open the same directories again. The
UTXO root, 56 monetary bytes, and state root match the connect result.
One monetary undo and one UTXO undo per committed transaction restore
the parent seed across another open. A 0x00 witness on a fresh seeded
pair leaves both files unchanged. This is a process restart of the two
files, not lotusd and not ConnectTip. The monetary rename is still not
atomic with the UTXO snapshot.
---
 src/lotus_v2/test_block_monetary_store.cpp | 212 ++++++++++++++++++++-
 1 file changed, 211 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/lotus_v2/test_block_monetary_store.cpp b/src/lotus_v2/test_block_monetary_store.cpp
index 8c0d8ebd3..421f71d45 100644
--- a/src/lotus_v2/test_block_monetary_store.cpp
